        <head>FOUND DEAD.</head>
        <p>FOUND DEAD.</p>
        <p>"IANFORD'S POISON for Killing Rats answers kJ well. "After on dressimel found 136 dead next morn- ing."—J. Bars, Heisthorpe, toilghton. "I killed 200 rate with Sanford's Polson."—O. Oomr, Farmer. Ellesmere. " destroyed 145 rats with It."—O. 'Rums, Offord.—Send le Id to SANFORD &amp; SONS, Sandy St. Beds. old by Oben:tilt&amp;</p>
