        <p>AIG B R,TH V. NEWTON-LE-WILLOWS.-At Newton- le-Willows on Saturday. Score : NEWTON-LE-WILLOWS. AIGBURTH. W. Turtonc Robertson b H. Pearson c Cooke b, Pearson 1 Olive ' W. Mitchell c Robertson F. Brewinb Cooke 2O b Pearson 23 C. Cattier c Cooke b H. Rylance b Pearson J. Olive b Pearson 9 A. W. Brock b Rylance 0 R. Carson run ont 36 F. Le Huray c Olive b T. Williams lbw b Pear- Rylance 3</p>
        <p>son 7 G. Welbnin b Turton... 0 T. Cooke b Robertson NV. Hindley b Robertson 14 A. Faulkner c Turton J. Richardson c Robert- b Olive</p>
        <p>son b Pearson 0 R. Robertson not out... 13 W. Jenkinson not out 6 J. Gilman c Robertson b Pearson 5 Extrw s</p>
